+
+    The mod's DBZP.BIN runs to 0x3C01D4, past the heap start the ELF hands SetupHeap (_end =
+    0x3BE71C), so the first malloc (the game's memory-pool header) sat on the mod's own code and was
+    overwritten when DBZP.BIN loaded (EE stack/heap filled with 0x28282828, main thread lost).
+    Start the heap at 0x3C1200 in both places that use _end: crt0's SetupHeap (0x1001D8) and the
+    pool-size computation (0x254F90). The pool top stays 0x1EFB000."""
